jQuery(document).ready(function(){function a(d,b){var c=b;if(lang=="es"){b+="_es"}else{if(lang=="de"){b+="_de"}}return(d[b]!==null)?d[b]:d[c]}"use strict";$(".img_zoom").magnificPopup({type:"image"});if($("#zona_blog").length>0){$.ajax({type:"POST",dataType:"JSON",url:"BlogGet.php",data:"",success:function(e){if(e.resp=="OK"){var c="";if(e.data.length>0){var b,d=0;$.each(e.data,function(f,g){b="blog_det.php?id="+g.id;c+='<div class="col-md-4 col-sm-6 col-xs-12">\n    <div class="probootstrap-hentry mb30">\n        <div class="image_max_size"><a href="'+b+'"><img src="admin/uploads/'+g.image+'" alt="" class="img-responsive"></a></div>\n        <h4 class="mt0"><a href="'+b+'" class="hover-reverse">'+a(g,"title")+'</a></h4>\n        <p class="text-mute">'+a(g,"brief")+'</p>\n        <p class="text-mute">'+g.fecha+" • "+g.category+"</p>\n    </div>\n</div>";d++;if(d>=3){d=0;c+='<div class="clearfix visible-lg-block visible-md-block"></div>\n'}})}$("#zona_blog").html(c)}else{$("#zona_blog").html("Error cargando noticias. "+e.data)}}})}});